                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "34-2-1 Transfers shall mean only those changes involving moves from one (1) building (school location) to another, or, in the case of Cluster SERS personnel, from one (1) Cluster to another. Exceptions will be made when advertised openings would result in an identified increased work year (e.g., teacher to counselor, teacher to information specialist), in which case, teachers within a building or SERS personnel within a Cluster may apply for said openings.",
            "block_bbox": [
                93,
